    "text": "Jon Stewart: ‘Democrats have forgotten government is only thing large enough to offset multinational, corporate exploitation and corruption’\nFeb. 13, 2025: 6:35 p.m.:\nJon Stewart: ‘Democrats have forgotten government is only thing large enough to offset multinational, corporate exploitation and corruption’\nJon Stewart and Former White House Press Secretary Jen Psaki discuss how democrats have lost control of everything: House, Senate, White House, Supreme Court…\nSTEWART: “I’ve been shocked by how undemocratic the Democratic Party can be.”\nPSAKI: “What do you mean?”\nSTEWART: “By putting their foot on the scales to make sure that Hillary Clinton comes out.”\nPSAKI: “Oh.” pic.twitter.com/S4Uxy4mzas\n— Chief Nerd (@TheChiefNerd) February 13, 2025\nWND Staff Elizabeth has been a freelance content writer for over 20 years and has enjoyed having her prose published in both the non-fiction and fiction markets. She has written a variety of different types of content, including Christian articles, healthy lifestyle, blog posts, business topics, news articles, product descriptions, and some fiction. She is also a singer-songwriter-musician. When she's not busy with writing or music, she enjoys spending time with friends or family and doing fun social activities such as hiking, swing dancing, attending concerts and other enjoyable activities. Read more of WND Staff's articles here.\nTrump Chronicles Show Full Content",
